<title>HUNGARY: Czech vehicle output up 14.7 pct in Q1 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech vehicle output up 14.7 pct in Q1 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech vehicle production increased 14.7 percent to 82,468 units in first-quarter 1997 from 71,929 units in first-quarter 1996, according to data provided to Reuters by the Automotive Industry Association of the Czech Republic.</p>
<p>								     PCT CHANGE</p>
<p> VEHICLE PRODUCTION	  Q1 1997	  Q1 1996  YEAR-ON-YEAR</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------  --buses			     198		202	    -2.0</p>
<p> --cars			   80,685	   69,961	   +15.3</p>
<p> --trucks			  1,585	    1,766	   -10.2</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------  TOTAL			    82,468	   71,929	   +14.7</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Ryan Tutak, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
